        <Param val="Welcome, and thank you for taking part!&amp;#10;This study takes about 5 minutes.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HOW THE TASK WORKS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;On each trial you will first see a QUESTION.&amp;#10;After a moment, a WORD will appear below it.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Answer the question about that word:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press  Y  for  YES&amp;#10;Press  N  for  NO&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to continue." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
